he UEFA Super Cup.\n\nIf you want more Kenya-focused betting analysis, bookmaker comparisons and match previews, keep an eye on SifuFinds at https://sifufinds.com for more local guides built for the Kenyan market.\n\n*18+ | Bet Responsibly | T&Cs Apply*",
